## A short story

I design and build digital experiences — from liquid-glass portfolio surfaces to
content systems that stay cheap to run.

This **About Story** used to live in Notion. It now ships as a Keystatic
singleton (`content/about-story/`) so the public site never needs Notion API
credentials.

### Focus

- Web development with modern Next.js
- Photography and visual storytelling
- Pragmatic tooling: Git CMS, object storage, near-zero subscriptions

If you want to collaborate, head over to the contact page and say hello.
